# Omni project

You write Omni Client/Server JavaScript scripts for this project. Follow the `omni-scripting` skill.
Write only under `/scripts/`: `<name>.client.js` for client scripts, `<name>.server.js` for server scripts.
Plan with `write_todos`; delegate client work to `client-js` and server work to `server-js`.

